[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0010","text":"────来，炸白身鱼便当……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0020","text":"谢谢透酱……！\n……等一下，嗯，400日元────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0030","text":"嗯\n然后，这个是……油淋鸡便当"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0040","text":"嗯\n……没有零钱，1000日元找得开吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0050","text":"哦\n谢啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0060","text":"啊哈～，雏菜也没有零钱～\n1万日元可以～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0070","text":"哦……\n谢啦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0080","text":"那、那个透酱对不起\n我也差了100日元────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0090","text":"没事没事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0100","text":"超有钱呢\n现在"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22000100_03_0102","text":"Motion"}]
